BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventclassicfilmseries3adone28099tlooknow197325974-20261008@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261006T163946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
SUMMARY:CLASSIC FILM Series: Don’t Look Now (1973)
DESCRIPTION:Don’t Look Now is a haunting psychological thriller widely regarded as one of the greatest horror films ever made. Starring Donald Sutherland and Julie Christie\, the film follows a grieving couple who travel to Venice after the tragic loss of their daughter. As they attempt to rebuild their lives\, unsettling visions and mysterious encounters blur the line between reality and the supernatural. Adapted from Daphne du Maurier’s acclaimed short story\, Don’t Look Now is celebrated for its atmospheric cinematography\, innovative editing\, and emotionally powerful performances. Set against the labyrinthine canals and shadowy streets of Venice\, the film creates a profound sense of suspense and unease. A landmark of 1970s cinema\, Don’t Look Now remains a mesmerizing exploration of grief\, fate\, and perception. STARS: Donald Sutherland\, Julie Chritie\, Adelina Peorio RUNTIME: 112 minutes GENRE: Horror\, Drama\, Thriller\, Action\, Mystery RATING: R The Weinberg Center\, located in the heart of Downtown Frederick\, MD\, offers a historic backdrop for a unique film experience.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/classic-film-series%3a-don%e2%80%99t-look-now-(1973)/25974/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventcharlescarrollofcarrollton3afredericke28099ssignerofthedeclarationofindependencewithjohngeorge25295-20261008@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261006T163946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
SUMMARY:Charles Carroll of Carrollton: Frederick’s Signer of the Declaration of Independence with John George
DESCRIPTION:As part of our ongoing efforts to celebrate America’s 250th\, Dr. John George will present Charles Carroll of Carrollton. Attendees will hear about Carroll’s life and legacy to The Bill of Rights\, transportation\, agriculture\, commerce\, and his descendants with a side note on the impact of the enslaved on 18th Century Frederick County.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/charles-carroll-of-carrollton%3a-frederick%e2%80%99s-signer-of-the-declaration-of-independence-with-john-george/25295/
