DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
SUMMARY:Good Trouble Troubadours
DESCRIPTION:Looking to get into a little good trouble on a Thursday night? With the midterms right around the corner\, approach this voting season with confidence and intention. Join us as we welcome Good Trouble Troubadours to the stage for an original\, high-energy set that bridges classic patriotism with grassroots protest music for modern times. By the soundtrack of the resistance\, get out there and vote!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/good-trouble-troubadours/26199/
