BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventlasc381c3b1ez25973-20261008@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261006T163946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
SUMMARY:Las Áñez
DESCRIPTION:Las Áñez presents twin sisters on stage singing their original Latin-American songs\, bringing energy\, rhythm\, and an infectious spark to Frederick. With four award-winning albums\, Las Áñez’s combination of folklore and contemporary music has captivated the public from 10 countries across America and Europe with their unique blend of folk and avant-garde for eight years. On stage\, Las Áñez fills every corner of the venue and pulls listeners into a hypnotic resounding ritual. The naturalness and versatility of this vocal Colombian duo is accompanied with minimal percussion\, a small keyboard\, and a loop station. Notable performances include: Rudolstadt Festival Folk Roots Weltmusik (Germany)\, Festival Fabbrica Europa (Italy)\, Historic Museum of Hannover (Germany)\, Millenium Stage of The Kennedy Center (USA)\, and many more. Learn more about the artists on their official website. This show is part of New Spire Arts’ programming. New Spire Stages\, located in the heart of Downtown Frederick\, MD\, offers an intimate venue for a memorable concert experience.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/las-%c3%81%c3%b1ez/25973/
END:VEVENT
