DESCRIPTION:A yoga class focused on stretching the body. Slow movements and long holds are emphasized in this class. Modifications are provided and welcome during your practice. All ages are welcome.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-city-parks-%26-rec%3a-senior-yoga/24650/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventgamenight24976-20261111@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261006T163946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261112
SUMMARY:Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us weekly and participate in a FREE poker tournament. Games start at 6:00pm and 8:00pm. Check out our large library of board games. Test your chess skill with a growing group of chess enthusiasts (all levels are welcome). Happy Hour Specials: $3 Beef Tacos\, $3 canned beer\, & $5 Margarita's
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/game-night/24976/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventopenmicnight25200-20261111@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261006T163946Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261112
SUMMARY:Open Mic Night
DESCRIPTION:The Frederick Acoustic Music Enterprise is bringing their iconic open mic night to the Sandbox for YOU to participate in! Hosted in our taproom on 1st Wednesday evenings at 6pm. Show up\, and take over our stage! We can’t wait to hear what you have in store for us. Free event. Food trucks are typically scheduled for Wednesday nights. Take a look at our weekly schedule (posted for the week ahead on Monday afternoons online and on our socials) to find out who will be here!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/open-mic-night/25200/
END:VEVENT
